{"id":"f0355544d1bb59cc","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md","title":"Semimartingale","display":"df-semimartingale — Semimartingale","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-semimartingale","aliases":["58-df-semimartingale"],"display":"df-semimartingale — Semimartingale","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-semimartingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-semimartingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-semimartingale — Semimartingale"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T\\in V\\)</span> (continuous-time filtered probability-space data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\\)</span> (predicates from the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StoppingTime}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StoppingTime}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StoppedProcess}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StoppedProcess}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdaptedFiniteVariation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AdaptedFiniteVariation}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Semimartingale}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Semimartingale}_S\\)</span> (semimartingale predicate defined here)</li>\n<li>停时和停止过程辅助接口接受任意实时间子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>；主半鞅接口仍由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}_S\\)</span> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\leq\\infty\">\\(t\\leq\\infty\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\\{t,\\infty\\}=t\">\\(\\min\\{t,\\infty\\}=t\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>），含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 的上确界在扩展实数中取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}probability\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}_S(\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\land T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbb F,T,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal A))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathbb F(t),\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathbb F(t)\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\leq t\\to\\mathbb F(s)\\subseteq\\mathbb F(t)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}probability\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}_S(\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\land T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbb F,T,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal A))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathbb F(t),\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathbb F(t)\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\leq t\\to\\mathbb F(s)\\subseteq\\mathbb F(t)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cadlag\\text{-}path}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S(x,T)\\leftrightarrow\nT=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(x,T,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(t\\leq s&lt;t+\\delta\\to|x(s)-x(t)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall t\\in T\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(t-\\delta&lt;s&lt;t\\to|x(s)-\\ell|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cadlag\\text{-}path}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S(x,T)\\leftrightarrow\nT=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(x,T,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(t\\leq s&lt;t+\\delta\\to|x(s)-x(t)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall t\\in T\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(t-\\delta&lt;s&lt;t\\to|x(s)-\\ell|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}cadlag}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S(X,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}_S(\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\!\\left(X(t);(\\Omega,\\mathbb F(t)),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\n\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S\n(\\{\\langle t,X(t)(\\omega)\\rangle:t\\in T\\},T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}cadlag}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S(X,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}_S(\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\!\\left(X(t);(\\Omega,\\mathbb F(t)),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\n\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S\n(\\{\\langle t,X(t)(\\omega)\\rangle:t\\in T\\},T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stopping\\text{-}time}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StoppingTime}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,T)\n\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\mathbb R\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbb F,\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbb F),\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbb F))\n\\land T\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbb F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,\\Omega,T\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\\tau(\\omega)\\leq t\\}\\in\\mathbb F(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stopping\\text{-}time}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StoppingTime}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,T)\n\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\mathbb R\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbb F,\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbb F),\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbb F))\n\\land T\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbb F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,\\Omega,T\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\\tau(\\omega)\\leq t\\}\\in\\mathbb F(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stopped\\text{-}process}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StoppedProcess}_S(Y,X,\\tau;T,\\Omega)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,\\Omega,T\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Y,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\nY(t)(\\omega)=X(\\min\\{t,\\tau(\\omega)\\})(\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stopped\\text{-}process}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StoppedProcess}_S(Y,X,\\tau;T,\\Omega)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,\\Omega,T\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Y,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\nY(t)(\\omega)=X(\\min\\{t,\\tau(\\omega)\\})(\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}martingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S(M,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\vec\\tau,N_\\infty\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,\\omega,(T\\cup\\{\\infty\\})^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{StoppingTime}_S(\\vec\\tau(n),\\mathbb F,\\Omega,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\n\\vec\\tau(n)(\\xi)\\leq\\vec\\tau(n+1)(\\xi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land N_\\infty=\n\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\sup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec\\tau(n)(\\xi)&lt;\\infty\\}\n\\land N_\\infty\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\mathbb P(N_\\infty)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StoppedProcess}_S(Y,M,\\vec\\tau(n);T,\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{29mm}\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\ns\\leq t\\to\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\n(Y(s),Y(t),\\mathbb F(s),\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}martingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S(M,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\vec\\tau,N_\\infty\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,\\omega,(T\\cup\\{\\infty\\})^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{StoppingTime}_S(\\vec\\tau(n),\\mathbb F,\\Omega,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\n\\vec\\tau(n)(\\xi)\\leq\\vec\\tau(n+1)(\\xi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land N_\\infty=\n\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\sup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec\\tau(n)(\\xi)&lt;\\infty\\}\n\\land N_\\infty\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\mathbb P(N_\\infty)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StoppedProcess}_S(Y,M,\\vec\\tau(n);T,\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{29mm}\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\ns\\leq t\\to\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\n(Y(s),Y(t),\\mathbb F(s),\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}finite\\text{-}variation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdaptedFiniteVariation}_S(A,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S(A,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\sup\\Biggl\\{\\sum_{j&lt;n}|A(t(j+1))(\\xi)-A(t(j))(\\xi)|\\;\\Biggm|\\;\nn\\in\\omega\\land t\\in T^{n+1}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land t(0)=0\\land t(n)=u\n\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;(t(j)&lt;t(j+1))\\Biggr\\}&lt;\\infty.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}finite\\text{-}variation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdaptedFiniteVariation}_S(A,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S(A,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\sup\\Biggl\\{\\sum_{j&lt;n}|A(t(j+1))(\\xi)-A(t(j))(\\xi)|\\;\\Biggm|\\;\nn\\in\\omega\\land t\\in T^{n+1}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land t(0)=0\\land t(n)=u\n\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;(t(j)&lt;t(j+1))\\Biggr\\}&lt;\\infty.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semimartingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Semimartingale}_S(X,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S(X,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists M,A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\land\\mathrm{AdaptedFiniteVariation}_S(A,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(M(0)(\\xi)=0\\land A(0)(\\xi)=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\nX(t)(\\xi)=X(0)(\\xi)+M(t)(\\xi)+A(t)(\\xi)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semimartingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Semimartingale}_S(X,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S(X,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists M,A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\land\\mathrm{AdaptedFiniteVariation}_S(A,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(M(0)(\\xi)=0\\land A(0)(\\xi)=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\nX(t)(\\xi)=X(0)(\\xi)+M(t)(\\xi)+A(t)(\\xi)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every filtration value is now a sigma-algebra on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> contained in the ambient event algebra, rather than merely an arbitrary subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Càdlàg paths, stopped processes, conditional-expectation martingale laws, monotone stopping times, almost-sure divergence of the localizing sequence, and pathwise finite variation are all explicitly bound.</li>\n<li>The normalization <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(0)=A(0)=0\">\\(M(0)=A(0)=0\\)</span> prevents the initial value of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> from being counted twice.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CondExp}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StoppingTime}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StoppedProcess}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdaptedFiniteVariation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Semimartingale}_S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\leq\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\min\\{t,\\infty\\}=t","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}probability\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}_S(\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\land T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbb F,T,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal A))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathbb F(t),\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathbb F(t)\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\leq t\\to\\mathbb F(s)\\subseteq\\mathbb F(t)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cadlag\\text{-}path}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S(x,T)\\leftrightarrow\nT=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(x,T,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall s\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(t\\leq s<t+\\delta\\to|x(s)-x(t)|<\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall t\\in T\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(t-\\delta<s<t\\to|x(s)-\\ell|<\\varepsilon\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}cadlag}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S(X,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}_S(\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\!\\left(X(t);(\\Omega,\\mathbb F(t)),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\n\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S\n(\\{\\langle t,X(t)(\\omega)\\rangle:t\\in T\\},T).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stopping\\text{-}time}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StoppingTime}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,T)\n\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\mathbb R\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbb F,\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbb F),\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbb F))\n\\land T\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbb F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,\\Omega,T\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\\tau(\\omega)\\leq t\\}\\in\\mathbb F(t).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stopped\\text{-}process}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StoppedProcess}_S(Y,X,\\tau;T,\\Omega)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nT\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,\\Omega,T\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Y,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\nY(t)(\\omega)=X(\\min\\{t,\\tau(\\omega)\\})(\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}martingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S(M,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists\\vec\\tau,N_\\infty\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,\\omega,(T\\cup\\{\\infty\\})^\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{StoppingTime}_S(\\vec\\tau(n),\\mathbb F,\\Omega,T)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\n\\vec\\tau(n)(\\xi)\\leq\\vec\\tau(n+1)(\\xi)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land N_\\infty=\n\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\sup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec\\tau(n)(\\xi)<\\infty\\}\n\\land N_\\infty\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\mathbb P(N_\\infty)=0\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StoppedProcess}_S(Y,M,\\vec\\tau(n);T,\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\hspace{29mm}\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\ns\\leq t\\to\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\n(Y(s),Y(t),\\mathbb F(s),\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}finite\\text{-}variation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdaptedFiniteVariation}_S(A,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S(A,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\sup\\Biggl\\{\\sum_{j<n}|A(t(j+1))(\\xi)-A(t(j))(\\xi)|\\;\\Biggm|\\;\nn\\in\\omega\\land t\\in T^{n+1}\\\\\n&\\hspace{42mm}\\land t(0)=0\\land t(n)=u\n\\land\\forall j<n\\;(t(j)<t(j+1))\\Biggr\\}<\\infty.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semimartingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Semimartingale}_S(X,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{AdaptedCadlag}_S(X,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists M,A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\land\\mathrm{AdaptedFiniteVariation}_S(A,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&\\hspace{24mm}\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(M(0)(\\xi)=0\\land A(0)(\\xi)=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{24mm}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\nX(t)(\\xi)=X(0)(\\xi)+M(t)(\\xi)+A(t)(\\xi)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"M(0)=A(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":6302,"backlinks":[{"id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}$ 取 [[../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"beeff998335147f4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d593b8d1d529b9a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Semimartingale}_S(X,\\mathbb F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)$ (real-valued semimartingale predicate, see [[58-df-semimartingale]])"},{"id":"c462e4cd1ccada77","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · d